    "['explicit-path [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ip explicit-path name tope2 enable', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'ip explicit-path name tope2 enable', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here is the equivalent Cisco command for the HUAWEI `explicit-path tope2` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nip explicit-path name tope2 enable\\nnext-hop 10.1.1.2\\nnext-hop 10.2.1.2\\nnext-hop 10.4.1.2\\nnext-hop 5.5.5.5\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- `ip explicit-path name tope2 enable` creates the named explicit path (equivalent to HUAWEI's `explicit-path tope2`).\\n- Each `next-hop` line corresponds to HUAWEI's `next hop` commands, specifying the path in the same order.\\n- Cisco requires `enable` to activate the path explicitly, while HUAWEI activates it by default when created.\", 'trans_template': 'ip explicit-path name tope2 enable'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'next-hop 10.1.1.2', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'next-hop 10.1.1.2', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here is the equivalent Cisco command for the HUAWEI `explicit-path tope2` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nip explicit-path name tope2 enable\\nnext-hop 10.1.1.2\\nnext-hop 10.2.1.2\\nnext-hop 10.4.1.2\\nnext-hop 5.5.5.5\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- `ip explicit-path name tope2 enable` creates the named explicit path (equivalent to HUAWEI's `explicit-path tope2`).\\n- Each `next-hop` line corresponds to HUAWEI's `next hop` commands, specifying the path in the same order.\\n- Cisco requires `enable` to activate the path explicitly, while HUAWEI activates it by default when created.\", 'trans_template': 'next-hop 10.1.1.2'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'next-hop 10.2.1.2', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'next-hop 10.2.1.2', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here is the equivalent Cisco command for the HUAWEI `explicit-path tope2` configuration:\\n\\n##\\nip explicit-path name tope2 enable\\nnext-hop 10.1.1.2\\nnext-hop 10.2.1.2\\nnext-hop 10.4.1.2\\nnext-hop 5.5.5.5\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n- `